From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 18:25:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] cli: source client association from detailed STA model

The controller's get_network topology representation can legitimately omit
STAList entries even while STAList in the controller model contains every
current association.  The dashboard treated that topology projection as the
authoritative association source, causing /clients and the topology overlay
to report zero clients during an otherwise complete cold reconstruction.

Build the client inventory from get_sta instead.  That command is the
controller's detailed associated-STA observation and carries the owning
device, radio, BSS, association state and link metrics in one tree.  Continue
to use get_network for device topology.  The topology overlay, WebSocket
initial state and client-metrics route now consume the same detailed client
snapshot as /clients.

This removes the last dependency on the topology projection containing STA
rows and does not read MariaDB or simulated wmediumd truth.

Upstream-Status: Pending

